{"id":"6a9264f67286f4b8","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-universal.md","title":"Representing Object","display":"df-universal — Representing Object","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-universal","aliases":["58-df-universal","Representing Object","Universal Property"],"display":"df-universal — Representing Object","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-universal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-universal</span><span>Representing Object</span><span>Universal Property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-universal — Representing Object"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal S,F,U,u\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal S,F,U,u\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalObject}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalObject}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{UniversalObject}_S(U,u,F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal S)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C,F_0,F_1\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C\\rangle\n\\land F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal S)\n\\land U\\in C_0\n\\land u\\in F_0(U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in C_0\\;\\forall x\\in F_0(X)\\;\n\\exists!f\\in C_1\\;\\bigl(\ns_C(f)=U\\land t_C(f)=X\n\\land F_1(f)(u)=x\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{UniversalObject}_S(U,u,F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal S)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C,F_0,F_1\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C\\rangle\n\\land F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal S)\n\\land U\\in C_0\n\\land u\\in F_0(U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in C_0\\;\\forall x\\in F_0(X)\\;\n\\exists!f\\in C_1\\;\\bigl(\ns_C(f)=U\\land t_C(f)=X\n\\land F_1(f)(u)=x\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial object: unique morphism to any object</li>\n<li>Terminal object: unique morphism from any object</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> is the explicit set-valued target category and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in F_0(U)\">\\(u\\in F_0(U)\\)</span> is the universal element.</li>\n<li>The displayed clause defines a representing object for the covariant functor <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>; representing objects are unique up to unique isomorphism compatible with the representation.</li>\n<li>Limits and colimits defined by universal properties</li>\n<li>Free objects: universal mapping property</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mac Lane, Categories for the Working Mathematician</li>\n<li>Awodey, Category Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal S,F,U,u\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalObject}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{UniversalObject}_S(U,u,F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal S)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C,F_0,F_1\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C\\rangle\n\\land F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal S)\n\\land U\\in C_0\n\\land u\\in F_0(U)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall X\\in C_0\\;\\forall x\\in F_0(X)\\;\n\\exists!f\\in C_1\\;\\bigl(\ns_C(f)=U\\land t_C(f)=X\n\\land F_1(f)(u)=x\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in F_0(U)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false}],"bytes":1601,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1357","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-universal.md|58-df-universal]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["877f1061e295cf5f","36d7463d215be751"]}